# Build artifacts.
dist/
.build/
*.zip
*.log

# Runtime state (delivery spool, tokens, rate-limit state, logs) — never committed.
/var/

# Local configuration only: the `config.php` created from `config.example.php`
# in the repository root.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing. Git matches .gitignore patterns
# case-insensitively when core.ignorecase is true (the default on case-sensitive
# filesystems such as macOS and Windows), so a bare `config.php` rule also
# matches `lib/Config.php` — the Config class silently stayed out of every commit,
# and a fresh clone fatalled on its first request because every entry point does
# `require_once lib/Config.php`. Keep this anchored.
/config.php
